  "recipeCuisine": "Italy",
  "name": "Ham Pea & Mushroom Sauce",
  "text": "Ham Pea & Mushroom Sauce\n\nPreparation time: 10 minutes\n\nYield: 4\n\nIngredients\n\n50 g (2 oz) butter,\n\n250 g (8 oz) mushrooms (thinly sliced),\n\n100 g (4 oz) frozen peas,\n\n300 ml (1/2 pint) single cream,\n\n125 g (4 oz) lean cooked ham (cut into matchstick strips),\n\n125 g Parmesan cheese (finely grated),\n\nsalt & pepper.\n\nPreparation\n\n1. Melt half the butter and gently fry the mushrooms until just tender. Season to taste.\n\n2. Meanwhile cook the peas in boiling salted water until tender, then drain.\n\n3. Put the remaining butter and cream into a saucepan and heat gently without allowing the mixture to boil.\n\n4. Add the mushrooms with their juice, the peas, and the ham.\n\n5. Add one third of the Parmesan cheese and heat.\n\n6. Serve with the remaining Parmesan cheese.",
  "prepTime": "PT10M",
  "cookTime": "PT15M",
  "recipeYield": "4",
  "recipeIngredient": [
    "50 g (2 oz) butter,",
    "250 g (8 oz) mushrooms (thinly sliced),",
